Chapter: BvtMinerLoop
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeGameRules
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtNpcMove
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 D-14 on BvtNpcMove's fixture: 1 Britain founds three miners, 2 a miner's song (say 6) is one of cgg-songs, 4 a strike
 (leg 2) waits a whole swing and a walk step does not, 8 a miner leaving its rock with ore to smelt and no lot walks
 straight to the forge (leg 6, not via its home door) while the smith is open, or home (leg 3) when it is shut; -1 to
 -3 a fixture that failed.
  bml-run : CompositeGame -> Integer
  bml-run (owner) = if list-length owner.miners < cgm-limit then -1
    else when owner.town
      is None -> -2
      is Just (t) -> when owner.town-map
        is None -> -3
        is Just (map) -> let c = list-at owner.miners 0
          in let three = if cgg-vein-worker c & cgg-vein-worker (list-at owner.miners (cgm-limit - 1)) & (list-length owner.miners == cgm-limit | not (cgg-vein-worker (list-at owner.miners (min cgm-limit (list-length owner.miners - 1))))) then 1 else 0
          in let sung = __record-set c "say" 6
          in let song = if bml-index cgg-songs (cgg-say-text c) 0 >= 0 then 2 else 0
          in let striking = __record-set c "leg" 2
          in let strike = cg-strike-pace c 1
          in let walking = __record-set c "leg" 1
          in let walk = cg-strike-pace c 1
          in let paced = if strike == cgw-swing-ticks & walk == 1 then 4 else 0
          in let a = (ep-actor c.gatherer.producer.currency.world c.gatherer.producer.actor)
          in let ore = ep-add a.stock cgg-ore 4
          in let unlotted = __record-set c "lot" 0
          in let back = __record-set c "leg" 2
          in let shut = cgg-shut c t
          in let left = cgg-mine-on c t map
          in let looped = if (if shut then c.leg == 3 else c.leg == 6 & c.via == 0) then 8 else 0
          in three + song + paced + looped
  bml-index : List Text, Text, Integer -> Integer
  bml-index (xs) (x) (i) = if i >= list-length xs then -1 else if list-at xs i == x then i else bml-index xs x (i + 1)
  bvt-miner-loop : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-miner-loop (unused) = when bnm-founded 0
    is Err (e) -> bvt-check ("miner loop fixture: " & e) False
    is Ok (owner) -> act
      n <- bml-run owner
      a <- bvt-check ("D-14: three miners, a song, a paced strike, and the rock-to-forge leg (code " & show n & ")") (n == 15)
      a
    end
